# Production UI refresh (Recyclo)

After changing app CSS or UI for Recyclo:

- If the app is served with `next start` / `npm start` / `npm run prod`, **rebuild and restart** before assuming styles are live: stop the server, run `npm run rebuild` (or `npm run build`), then `npm start`. Tell the user to hard-refresh (Ctrl+Shift+R).
- If using `npm run dev` / `next dev`, a save + browser refresh is enough — no rebuild.
- Prefer mentioning which mode you used. Production serves `.next`; source CSS edits are invisible until rebuild.

Node PATH tip (Windows): if `node`/`npm` are missing, prepend `$env:TEMP\recyclo-node\node-v24.22.1-win-x64` to `$env:Path`.
